      <p>Head west two screens and you&#x27;ll see a path below you. Slowly take a step down and swing your sword periodically, hoping to reveal a hidden trap that would have otherwise damaged everyone. At the bottom is a chest which contains SNIPER ROUNDS (ATK+20/MAG+3) that you can sell. Push the nearby barrel around the winding path to the left and down to blow away the rocks blocking a chest which contains 3 HERBAL TEAs. In the cave above is a chest which contains 2 POWER DOWN PLUS.</p>

      <p>Return to the entrance at Old Spring East and take the north exit this time. Simply go straight north to reach the exit to the Sand Fortress. You should rest up back at Alistel before continuing to the Sand Fortress.</p>
